title: 'virustotal: R Client for the ''VirusTotal'' API'
version: 0.7.0
identifiers:
- type: doi
  value: 10.32614/CRAN.package.virustotal
abstract: Provides a comprehensive R interface to the 'VirusTotal' API v3.0 <https://docs.virustotal.com/>,
  a Google service that analyzes files and URLs for viruses, worms, trojans and other
  malware. Features include file/URL scanning, domain categorization, passive DNS
  information, IP reputation analysis, IoC relationships, sandbox analysis, and comment/voting
  systems. Implements rate limiting, error handling, and response validation for robust
  security analysis workflows.
